          </div>
          <h3 class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-zinc-50 mb-3">Infrastructure &amp; Networking</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Virtualized environments, containers, and the network gear they run on.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Proxmox VE</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Docker</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Linux (Debian)</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Cisco/Meraki</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Hyper-V</span>
