          <h3 class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-zinc-50 mb-3">Tools &amp; Workflow</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            What I use to keep work organized and documented.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Git &amp; GitHub</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded font-mono text-xs">Azure Repos</span>
